{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": "030B",
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER030B.YBC",
      "sha256": "587758031aa9f3c040bf895a58072b2822bb1bb4f2f3f37b4a7ee8e0c4657ed0",
      "text_count": 99,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 130,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "法娜……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 180,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            1
          ],
          "text": "……艾爾雪。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 214,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            2
          ],
          "text": "我好想見妳呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 248,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            3
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯，我也是。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 282,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            4
          ],
          "text": "見到妳平安無事真好。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 316,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            5
          ],
          "text": "……只有我從那裡逃出來了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 338,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "妳知道其他人的情況怎樣了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 372,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            7
          ],
          "text": "他們都被囚禁在眺望萬物的尖塔。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 394,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            8
          ],
          "text": "至少薛莉爾是這樣說的，另外……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 428,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            9
          ],
          "text": "……這樣啊。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 450,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            10
          ],
          "text": "大家都被關起來了嗎……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 478,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            11,
            12
          ],
          "text": "雖然這樣並不是什麼好事，但還是太好了，\n真的……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 500,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "大家都還活著真是太好了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 540,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            14,
            15
          ],
          "text": "我見過了紐‧普勞迪斯之後，\n從他所說的話來推斷，應該也是這樣。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 574,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            16
          ],
          "text": "妳去過帕蘭達因了？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 608,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            17
          ],
          "text": "抱歉。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 642,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            18
          ],
          "text": "……妳還真是都沒變呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 670,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            19,
            20
          ],
          "text": "但是，如果妳是去做了什麼無理逞強的事情的\n話～"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 692,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "那我可是不會原諒妳的唷。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 726,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            22
          ],
          "text": "呵。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 760,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            23
          ],
          "text": "呵呵。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 782,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            24
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 816,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            25
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 850,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            26
          ],
          "text": "老師……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 876,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            27
          ],
          "text": "妳就是聖瑟維艾斯的艾爾雪‧貝爾薩對吧？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 898,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            28
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 928,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            29
          ],
          "text": "我想你已經看出來了吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 950,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "那你是？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 988,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            31,
            32,
            33
          ],
          "text": "……我是暫時管理伊諾森提雅事務的人。\n說到貝爾薩這個姓氏……\n就讓我想起了一位偉大的前輩。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1014,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            34
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1046,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            35,
            36
          ],
          "text": "菲迪‧貝爾薩……\n她也曾經在純潔之盾和我們一同求學。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1086,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            37,
            38
          ],
          "text": "你是第一個聽到了貝爾薩的姓氏，\n卻沒有問我跟「劍聖」是什麼關係的人呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1118,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            39,
            40
          ],
          "text": "雖然她做事風格保守……\n卻也是個有話直說的人呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1152,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            41
          ],
          "text": "原來母親她……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1178,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            42
          ],
          "text": "母親……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1212,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            43
          ],
          "text": "這樣啊，原來是這樣啊。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1234,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            44
          ],
          "text": "這大概就是所謂的因緣吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1260,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            45
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1300,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            46,
            47
          ],
          "text": "愛爾梅納斯在混沌之中喘息，\n聖瑟維艾斯屈服在那混沌的毒牙之下。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1328,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            48,
            49
          ],
          "text": "葛斯貝布洛的疲病無所隱藏，\n帕蘭達因的專橫昭然若揭。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1354,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            50
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1386,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            51,
            52
          ],
          "text": "在這危急的時刻，\n純潔之盾的意志又是如何？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1408,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            53
          ],
          "text": "我可以聽聽看嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1440,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            54,
            55
          ],
          "text": "……帕蘭達因認為黑闇是混沌的根源，\n因此毫不留情地攻打了聖瑟維艾斯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1462,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            56
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1484,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            57
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1516,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            58,
            59
          ],
          "text": "無論他們有什麼理由也好……\n我們也得向帕蘭達因問個清楚。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1542,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            60
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1580,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            61,
            62,
            63
          ],
          "text": "但首先，我們必須回到「白皙的城砦」─\n安蒂米昂去，並且升起級旗，\n宣告四大學級之一的純潔之盾回來了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1614,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            64
          ],
          "text": "就算回到了安蒂米昂……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1642,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            65,
            66
          ],
          "text": "你們的對手，\n可是擁有賢者圓桌做為靠山的帕蘭達因呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1664,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            67
          ],
          "text": "你的意見又能傳達給他們多少？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1714,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            68,
            69,
            70,
            71,
            72
          ],
          "text": "在我們的想法可以完全地傳達給他們之前，\n我們都會繼續努力。\n純潔之盾有著這樣的決心，\n我們純潔之盾不會忘記過去曾經受過聖瑟維艾\n斯的恩惠。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1748,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            73
          ],
          "text": "這是你們所有人的共識嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1770,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            74
          ],
          "text": "這其中連一絲一毫的虛假都沒有嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1796,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            75
          ],
          "text": "我希望妳能用自己的雙眼來確認，艾爾雪。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1822,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            76
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1860,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            77,
            78,
            79
          ],
          "text": "我希望能夠獲得妳的幫助，\n在混亂的愛爾梅納斯裡前進的時候，\n妳的劍對我們來說是必要的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1912,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            80,
            81,
            82,
            83
          ],
          "text": "……無論是光明或是黑闇，\n甚至連道義都無法貫徹。\n所以，我所能做的事情，\n就只有磨利這把劍了吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1934,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            84
          ],
          "text": "如果心中有所疑惑，劍刃將會變鈍。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1960,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            85
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 1992,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            86,
            87
          ],
          "text": "那麼，我就將我的劍刃磨到透明，\n斬斷心中的迷霧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 2020,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            88,
            89
          ],
          "text": "如果不能對任何人都誠心相待的話，\n至少就讓我與劍一體共存吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 2046,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            90
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 2080,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            91
          ],
          "text": "你說了，它是必要的呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 2102,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            92
          ],
          "text": "無論是誰都不願意肯定的，我的劍呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 2128,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            93
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 2162,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            94
          ],
          "text": "你真是一個善良的人。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 2184,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            95
          ],
          "text": "真是超乎我期待的答案呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 2206,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            96
          ],
          "text": "我艾爾雪‧貝爾薩。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "030B",
          "source_offset": 2234,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            97,
            98
          ],
          "text": "加入了純潔之盾以後，\n一定會竭盡全力地幫助您完成心願。"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "offset": 20,
          "opcode": 144,
          "operands": [
            6
          ]
        },
        {
          "offset": 28,
          "opcode": 144,
          "operands": [
            115
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chapter": 31,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER031.YBC",
      "sha256": "d90ace89b7e55508a3124ab8a33dadae9c74e0316596e6e9143ae50680a32e5f",
      "text_count": 110,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 210,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            0,
            1,
            2
          ],
          "text": "學長……我不瞭解……\n為什麼帕蘭達因的總帥─修奈鐸‧華倫斯提，\n會把聖瑟維艾斯當作是混沌的根源呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 252,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            3,
            4,
            5,
            6,
            7
          ],
          "text": "他把與聖瑟維艾斯所執掌光明互補的黑闇力量\n稱為混沌。\n然而，奈比洛斯閣下怎麼可能……\n為什麼要散播這些毫無憑據的謠言呢？\n我沒有辦法接受……！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 294,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            8,
            9,
            10,
            11,
            12
          ],
          "text": "因為拒絕一起跟「匍伏蔓延而來之物」作戰，\n以及讓出能夠消除混沌的愛爾梅納斯密寶─\n十二王杯……\n奈比洛斯閣下保持沉默，\n卻也因此承受了一切指責……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 332,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "就算如此，妳現在也相信著妳的老師嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 376,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            14,
            15,
            16,
            17
          ],
          "text": "……是的。\n奈比洛斯閣下被囚禁的時候，\n我本來也想追隨她的腳步一起被囚禁的……\n然而那時候，我卻被羅弗利先生給救了出來。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 402,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            18
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 420,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            19
          ],
          "text": "他代替我受刑，以他自己的名譽起誓……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 446,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            20
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 472,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            21
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 508,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            22,
            23,
            24,
            25
          ],
          "text": "《不顧一切危險，\n　奈比洛斯閣下堅持沉默……\n　她恐怕是抱著讓沉思的聖堂毀滅的覺悟，\n　才因此拒絕的。》"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 540,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            26,
            27
          ],
          "text": "…………\n現在十二王杯的下落是……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 584,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            28,
            29,
            30,
            31
          ],
          "text": "帕蘭達因擁有三個，\n在葛斯貝布洛收藏著一個，\n而聖瑟維艾斯保管了七個，\n剩下的一個目前不知去向……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 616,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            32,
            33
          ],
          "text": "聖瑟維艾斯不愧是四大學級之首呀，\n可是，純潔之盾裡竟然一個也沒有嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 660,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            34,
            35,
            36,
            37
          ],
          "text": "九年前……\n學長們曾經將所有的十二王杯都贏回來，\n那份成就的偉大，\n就算是現在，我也能夠感受得到。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 692,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            38,
            39
          ],
          "text": "勝利女神是不可捉摸的呀，\n而且那時候的情況跟現在也不太一樣。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 718,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            40
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 744,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            41
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 788,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            42,
            43,
            44,
            45
          ],
          "text": "學長……\n為了對抗利用元素力量的魔法，\n人們創造了光明的魔法。\n而那光明的力量，來自於黑闇的話語中。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 814,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            46
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 844,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            47,
            48,
            49
          ],
          "text": "我認為這兩種法術都是榮耀的存在，\n並且一直深愛著這份光榮。\n而學長你……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 882,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            50,
            51,
            52
          ],
          "text": "也認為那黑闇……\n因為被稱為黑闇，所以……\n就相當於被稱為混沌的邪惡存在嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 908,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            53
          ],
          "text": "都到了這種時候，何必再問這種問題呢。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 952,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            54,
            55,
            56,
            57
          ],
          "text": "就因為我曾經追隨沉思的聖堂，\n所以我才會感受到這一分榮耀。\n並且也因為我能體會黑闇的安寧……\n所以黑闇與混沌之間的疑問令我恐懼呀！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 984,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            58,
            59
          ],
          "text": "人都可能對無法看穿的黑闇感到畏懼，\n所以會有害怕黑闇的本能。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1010,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            60
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1042,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            61,
            62
          ],
          "text": "然而，聖瑟維艾斯所學習的知識，\n對純潔之盾來說，是遙不可及的珍貴資產。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1068,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            63
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1110,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            64,
            65,
            66,
            67,
            68
          ],
          "text": "有人會對這樣的力量有所感念，\n也有人卻會對這樣的力量感到厭惡。\n而我則是想要去拯救那將慈愛的光明與安寧的\n黑闇分享給我們的，\n四大學級之一的盟友。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1134,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            69,
            70
          ],
          "text": "孩子們也抱著這樣的想法，\n想去援救聖瑟維艾斯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1178,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            71,
            72,
            73,
            74
          ],
          "text": "學長……\n我覺得您是以率直的、有活力的、毫無虛偽的\n笑容，\n這麼周到地照顧著伊諾森提雅的孩子們……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1204,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            75
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1226,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            76
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1264,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            77
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1296,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            78,
            79
          ],
          "text": "我希望您也能在我有所迷惑的時候，\n在我身邊守護我。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1328,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "老师",
          "text_indices": [
            80,
            81
          ],
          "text": "嗯嗯。\n而我也希望妳能夠好好地守護那些孩子們。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1354,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            82
          ],
          "text": "是的……！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1470,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            83,
            84
          ],
          "text": "既然我們面對的，\n是賢者所不能對抗的混沌……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1492,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            85
          ],
          "text": "果然還是需要十二王杯的力量吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1530,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            86
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1564,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            87
          ],
          "text": "這是解開隱藏在愛爾梅納斯裡的秘密關鍵。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1598,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            88,
            89,
            90
          ],
          "text": "因為這份力量是如此地高貴，\n甚至是過分地強大，\n所以才會被分散在十二王杯之中。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1630,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            91,
            92
          ],
          "text": "不知道從什麼時候開始，\n那個就成為了四大學級之間競賽的戰利品。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1652,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            93
          ],
          "text": "而這些奇蹟的結晶，帶來了眾神的祝福。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1678,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            94
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1718,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            95,
            96
          ],
          "text": "為了追求那消滅混沌的奇蹟，\n帕蘭達因朝著追求十二王杯而前進。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1746,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            97,
            98
          ],
          "text": "奈比洛斯‧盧希弗吉寧可接受他人的指責，\n也不願意交出十二王杯。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1772,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            99
          ],
          "text": "奈比洛斯恐怕已經……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1798,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            100
          ],
          "text": "老師。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1832,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            101
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1858,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            102
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1892,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            103
          ],
          "text": "唔……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1914,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            104
          ],
          "text": "我們重返安蒂米昂的時機，究竟會是何時呢？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1946,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            105,
            106
          ],
          "text": "那時機總有一天會到來吧。\n那就是孩子們將思念傳達給我們的時候。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 1980,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            107
          ],
          "text": "那麼，我們就只有好好地守護他們了。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 31,
          "source_offset": 2012,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            108,
            109
          ],
          "text": "是的。\n希望老師多多協助。"
        }
      ],
